OL,3,GNEWSACancer patients 'deteriorating'
OL,4,Adue to staff shortages, radiologists
OL,5,Awarn
OL,6,
OL,7,FCancer patients have warned delays in
OL,8,Fscans could be the difference between
OL,9,Flife and death as Wales faces a
OL,10,Fshortage of radiologists.
OL,12,FThe Royal College of Radiologists said
OL,13,FNHS Wales currently had 88 fewer
OL,14,Fradiologists than it needed - a 28%
OL,15,Fshortfall.
OL,17,FFor the first time, it has reported
OL,18,Fseeing some patients' conditions
OL,19,F"deteriorating" while waiting for
OL,20,Fdiagnostic scans and tests.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
